#. SourceLocation:	/Script/MacroKeyboardEditor.MacroContextLighting [ScriptStruct ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/MacroKeyboardEditor.MacroContextLighting [ScriptStruct ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,MacroContextLighting"
msgid "Backlight to apply while a given editor context is in front."
msgstr "某个编辑器上下文在前台时使用的背光。"

