#. SourceLocation:	/Script/MacroKeyboardEditor.MacroKeyboardBinding:Context [StrProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/MacroKeyboardEditor.MacroKeyboardBinding:Context [StrProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,MacroKeyboardBinding:Context"
msgid "Context"
msgstr "上下文"

#. Key:	MacroKeyboardBinding:Context
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/MacroKeyboardEditor.MacroKeyboardBinding:Context [StrProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/MacroKeyboardEditor.MacroKeyboardBinding:Context [StrProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,MacroKeyboardBinding:Context"
msgid "Context id reported by the plugin: levelEditor, sequencer, animation, animBlueprint, pie, simulate, editor…"
msgstr "插件回报的上下文 id：levelEditor、sequencer、animation、animBlueprint、pie、simulate、editor…"

#. Key:	MacroKeyboardBinding:Control
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/MacroKeyboardEditor.MacroKeyboardBinding:Control [StrProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/MacroKeyboardEditor.MacroKeyboardBinding:Control [StrProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,MacroKeyboardBinding:Control"
msgid "Control"
msgstr "控件"

#. Key:	MacroKeyboardBinding:Control
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/MacroKeyboardEditor.MacroKeyboardBinding:Control [StrProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/MacroKeyboardEditor.MacroKeyboardBinding:Control [StrProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,MacroKeyboardBinding:Control"
msgid "Control id from MacroHub: K1…K9, K0, KDOT, KENTER, KMINUS, KPLUS, KSPACE, KNOB_CW/CCW/PRESS, JOY_*."
msgstr "MacroHub 的控件 id：K1…K9、K0、KDOT、KENTER、KMINUS、KPLUS、KSPACE、KNOB_CW/CCW/PRESS、JOY_*。"

#. Key:	MacroKeyboardBinding:DetentsPerTrigger
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/MacroKeyboardEditor.MacroKeyboardBinding:DetentsPerTrigger [IntProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/MacroKeyboardEditor.MacroKeyboardBinding:DetentsPerTrigger [IntProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,MacroKeyboardBinding:DetentsPerTrigger"
msgid "Detents Per Trigger"
msgstr "每几格触发一次"

#. Key:	MacroKeyboardBinding:DetentsPerTrigger
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/MacroKeyboardEditor.MacroKeyboardBinding:DetentsPerTrigger [IntProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/MacroKeyboardEditor.MacroKeyboardBinding:DetentsPerTrigger [IntProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,MacroKeyboardBinding:DetentsPerTrigger"
msgid "Detents per trigger for a rotary control: the pad reports several steps per physical click, so 3 here means\none click moves the timeline once. 1 acts on every step."
msgstr "旋转类控件每几格触发一次：键盘每转一档会上报多格，这里填 3 表示\n转一档移动一次时间轴。1 表示每格都触发。"

#. Key:	MacroKeyboardBinding:DisplayName
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/MacroKeyboardEditor.MacroKeyboardBinding:DisplayName [StrProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/MacroKeyboardEditor.MacroKeyboardBinding:DisplayName [StrProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,MacroKeyboardBinding:DisplayName"
msgid "Display Name"
msgstr "显示名称"

#. Key:	MacroKeyboardBinding:DisplayName
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/MacroKeyboardEditor.MacroKeyboardBinding:DisplayName [StrProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/MacroKeyboardEditor.MacroKeyboardBinding:DisplayName [StrProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,MacroKeyboardBinding:DisplayName"
msgid "Name shown on the key cap in the MacroKeyboard panel; empty shows the action itself (e.g. the shortcut)."
msgstr "MacroKeyboard 面板键帽上显示的名称；留空则显示动作本身（例如快捷键）。"

#. Key:	MacroKeyboardBinding:HoldMultiplier
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/MacroKeyboardEditor.MacroKeyboardBinding:HoldMultiplier [IntProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/MacroKeyboardEditor.MacroKeyboardBinding:HoldMultiplier [IntProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,MacroKeyboardBinding:HoldMultiplier"
msgid "Hold Multiplier"
msgstr "按住旋转倍数"

#. Key:	MacroKeyboardBinding:HoldMultiplier
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/MacroKeyboardEditor.MacroKeyboardBinding:HoldMultiplier [IntProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/MacroKeyboardEditor.MacroKeyboardBinding:HoldMultiplier [IntProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,MacroKeyboardBinding:HoldMultiplier"
msgid "Rotary controls: how much further a detent moves while the knob is held down during the turn. 1 turns it off.\nWhen a context uses it, the knob press becomes a modifier there and its own binding runs as a click on release."
msgstr "旋转类控件：按住旋钮旋转时每格移动的倍数。1 为关闭。\n某个上下文使用它时，该上下文里旋钮按下变成修饰键，它自己的绑定改为松开时作为单击触发。"

#. Key:	MacroKeyboardEditorSettings
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/MacroKeyboardEditor.MacroKeyboardEditorSettings [Class DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/MacroKeyboardEditor.MacroKeyboardEditorSettings [Class DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,MacroKeyboardEditorSettings"
msgid "MacroKeyboard (Editor)"
msgstr "宏键盘（编辑器）"

#. Key:	MacroKeyboardEditorSettings
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/MacroKeyboardEditor.MacroKeyboardEditorSettings [Class ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/MacroKeyboardEditor.MacroKeyboardEditorSettings [Class ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,MacroKeyboardEditorSettings"
msgid "Editor Preferences → Plugins → MacroKeyboard (Editor): which control does what in which editor."
msgstr "编辑器偏好设置 → 插件 → 宏键盘（编辑器）：哪个控件在哪个编辑器里做什么。"

#. Key:	MacroKeyboardEditorSettings:bDriveLighting
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/MacroKeyboardEditor.MacroKeyboardEditorSettings:bDriveLighting [BoolProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/MacroKeyboardEditor.MacroKeyboardEditorSettings:bDriveLighting [BoolProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,MacroKeyboardEditorSettings:bDriveLighting"
msgid "Drive Lighting"
msgstr "接管灯光"

#. Key:	MacroKeyboardEditorSettings:bDriveLighting
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/MacroKeyboardEditor.MacroKeyboardEditorSettings:bDriveLighting [BoolProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/MacroKeyboardEditor.MacroKeyboardEditorSettings:bDriveLighting [BoolProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,MacroKeyboardEditorSettings:bDriveLighting"
msgid "Let the editor tint the pad: each context below gets its own backlight while it is in front."
msgstr "由编辑器控制键盘背光：下面的每个上下文在前台时使用自己的背光。"

#. Key:	Bindings
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/MacroKeyboardEditor.MacroKeyboardEditorSettings:Bindings [ArrayProperty Category meta-data]
#: /Script/MacroKeyboardEditor.MacroKeyboardEditorSettings:Bindings [ArrayProperty Category meta-data]
