#: /Script/MacroKeyboardEditor.MacroKeyboardEditorSettings:Bindings [ArrayProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,MacroKeyboardEditorSettings:Bindings"
msgid "Bindings"
msgstr "绑定"

#. Key:	MacroKeyboardEditorSettings:bLogControlEvents
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/MacroKeyboardEditor.MacroKeyboardEditorSettings:bLogControlEvents [BoolProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/MacroKeyboardEditor.MacroKeyboardEditorSettings:bLogControlEvents [BoolProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,MacroKeyboardEditorSettings:bLogControlEvents"
msgid "Log Control Events"
msgstr "记录按键日志"

#. Key:	MacroKeyboardEditorSettings:bLogControlEvents
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/MacroKeyboardEditor.MacroKeyboardEditorSettings:bLogControlEvents [BoolProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/MacroKeyboardEditor.MacroKeyboardEditorSettings:bLogControlEvents [BoolProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,MacroKeyboardEditorSettings:bLogControlEvents"
msgid "Write every control the editor acts on to the Output Log (\"KNOB_CW [sequencer] -> timeline scrub…\").\nOff by default; the same lines stay available at Verbose (`log LogMacroKeyboard Verbose`)."
msgstr "把编辑器执行的每个控件写入输出日志（\"KNOB_CW [sequencer] -> timeline scrub…\"）。\n默认关闭；关闭时同样的内容仍可在 Verbose 级别查看（`log LogMacroKeyboard Verbose`）。"

#. Key:	MacroKeyboardEditorSettings:ContextLighting
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/MacroKeyboardEditor.MacroKeyboardEditorSettings:ContextLighting [ArrayProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/MacroKeyboardEditor.MacroKeyboardEditorSettings:ContextLighting [ArrayProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,MacroKeyboardEditorSettings:ContextLighting"
msgid "Context Lighting"
