#. SourceLocation:	/Script/MacroKeyboardRuntime.MacroKeyboardSubsystem [Class ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/MacroKeyboardRuntime.MacroKeyboardSubsystem [Class ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,MacroKeyboardSubsystem"
msgid "Owns the MacroHub connection and delivers control events on the game thread.\n\nLives in the editor and in game builds; the editor module adds context detection and editor actions on top.\nEvents arrive on a background thread and are drained once per frame, so handlers run at a predictable point."
msgstr "持有 MacroHub 连接，并在游戏线程上分发控件事件。\n\n编辑器和游戏版本中都存在；编辑器模块在此之上增加上下文识别和编辑器动作。\n事件在后台线程到达，每帧统一处理一次，因此处理函数在可预期的时机运行。"

